IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `or336-cases-seat`
IMPORT `or336-cases-seat-employer`

-- Mirror cases: the same facts put to the employee's seat and to the employer's
-- seat must give the same answer, because both seats read the same layer-1
-- rules. Each assertion compares a case of or336-cases-seat.l4 with its twin
-- in or336-cases-seat-employer.l4. A disagreement means that one seat
-- builds its records wrongly.

§ `Mirror cases: the two seats agree`

